flowchart LR
    U[User / Team] --> UI[QALY Web/Mobile]
    UI --> BE[QALY Backend API]
    BE --> SQL[(SQL Server Source of Truth)]
    BE --> REDIS[(Redis Queue/Cache)]
    BE --> AIGW[AI Gateway]
    AIGW --> CACHE[(AI Prompt Cache)]
    AIGW --> LEDGER[(AI Usage Ledger)]
    AIGW --> API[AI API Primary]
    AIGW --> MOCK[Mock Provider]
    AIGW --> LOCAL[Local AI Gateway via ngrok]
    LOCAL --> MEETILY[Meetily Desktop/Export]
    LOCAL --> OLLAMA[Ollama 7B/8B Fallback]
    BE -. P1 optional .-> QDRANT[(Qdrant Semantic Memory)]
    SQL --> DRAFT[(AI Generated Drafts)]
    DRAFT --> REVIEW[Human Review/Confirm]
